Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, tabidatsu fune wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, a ship is taking off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\pos(589,213)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:33.40,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(650,904)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\\pos(1402,642)}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ucyuu no kanata Iskandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's about to take off to Iscandar carrying the fate of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We'll return for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Smile back at the people waving their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:03.05,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:03.05,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.54,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:38.32,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The twin planet to our Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:44.68,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's the planet of love, which plots\N the salvation of all intelligent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:51.94,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's the guiding light and spiritual \Nsupport for the culture of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:10.56,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Starsha, the first time\N I saw you, you looked so mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:28.28,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{What did you tell me at that moment...}What were you trying\Nto tell me at that moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:33.40,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Visual signal received from Evacuation Fleet 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:39.08,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Long live, Desler. \NWe'll see you in the new world, Galman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:42.88,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Tell them that I pray for their safe voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:43.88,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:54.08,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,This marks one third of our population, \Nbut I hear many are still refusing to migrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.16,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,{We have two weeks to reach\N the home planet of Garmillas.}The trip to the home planet\N of Gamilas will take us two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:02.02,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,{Your Excellency, if you call out \Nto them, they'll change their tune.}Your Excellency, if you appeal to those that remain on Garmillas, surely the skeptics will change their tune…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:05.92,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,You mean after hearing from \Nsomeone aboard {\i1}this{\i0} ship, Talan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.55,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,My sincerest apologies !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:13.14,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,{I apologize for not being able to \Nrepaint Your Excellency's ship in noble blue.}Applying the noble blue color to Your Excellency's\N command ship will be done with as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.14,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Sometimes red is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:30.78,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Garmillas is currently undergoing a mass migration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:37.14,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{sono}They're at odds with an interstellar\N alliance called the Bolar Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:39.36,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{shokun}You must be aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.18,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,The situation is tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:49.08,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,As members of the Earth Defense Force, you have a very important responsibility at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:58.06,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{uchuu}Defense Fleet 65, with the space battleship Yamato as its flagship, will begin a long voyage to the Magellanic Cloud...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:04:02.68,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{Garmillas}...in order to escort our delegation\N to Garmillas and Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:09.56,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{kuwaete}In addition, this long trip will serve as an\N important training mission for the new crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:14.76,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,As you know, the Yamato is known for prioritizing human lives over military readiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:18.42,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,, It represents our policy of peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:23.64,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,It's not an oversight. \NSomeone must've deliberately falsified personnel data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.94,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,It could've been Domon himself, \Nso that he could sneak on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.58,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,He was a top achiever at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:37.02,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,, If not for his father's case, he would've \Nbeen assigned to the Yamato anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.64,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,He could be dangerous, Captain Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:43.26,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,He may have infiltrated the \NYamato with a grudge against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.24,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Declaration !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:55.46,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,We pledge to do everything we can to complete our duties to maintain Earth's peace and prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:05:01.40,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Domon Ryusuke, representing the 38th class of students of the Space Defense Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:19.92,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:24.60,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,As Captain of the Yamato,\N I have an order for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:27.32,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,, Domon Ryusuke, take the \Nhelm for the ship's departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.78,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,We're departing early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:47.76,def2,{ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,Unexpected things happen \Non the battlefield. Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.76,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,What's going on ?\N Why is Ryusuke on the first bridge ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.76,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,How would I know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:02.16,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Domon, what did you do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.16,def2,{SADO,0,0,0,,Hey, newbie !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:04.72,def2,{SADO,0,0,0,,Sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.72,def2,{SADO,0,0,0,,Departure position, remember ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.62,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Our men are all on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.06,def2,{NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Yamato hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.06,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Is that so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:42.00,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:46.58,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,I was supposed to lead the departure.\N If you mess up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.10,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Trying to kick me out...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.94,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I won't quit, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.48,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Tactical officer Domon, you have control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:15.40,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Tactical officer Domon, I have control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.98,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Prepare for departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:27.40,def2,{OHTA,0,0,0,,Captain Sanada, is it true that a \Nnewbie is going to fly the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:30.70,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,It's too late to call this a surprise prank...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.36,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,Ship functions all green.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.82,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,All personnel in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:42.14,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Auxiliary power is online.{'s warmed up.}\NDomon, we can go any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.42,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:48.54,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,Relax your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.02,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Auxiliary engine, channel power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.54,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Auxiliary engine, channeling power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.00,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Relax{Be easy}, Tokugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:01.42,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,C...contact
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:04.98,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Auxiliary engine, low speed rev at 1600.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:08.52,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Output balance of both thrusters is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.28,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Ahead slow, 0.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.84,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Auxiliary engine, from contact 2 to contact 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:25.12,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine, \Nopen the cylinder shut-down valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:26.94,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Shut-down valve...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:30.06,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Wait, Tasuke.\NWhat's the ship's current speed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.58,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,It's four. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.30,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Input done !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.00,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Opening the shut-down valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:45.22,def2,{MIKAGE,0,0,0,,What ? The Yamato stalled ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:46.50,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,I'll slow down the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.64,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,No, keep going. All ahead flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.10,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Change of formation. \NHyuga and Asuka will go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.32,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Acknowledged. \NAs expected, their response is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:06.58,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Idiot ! It's speed 3 ! \NWhat did you learn in school ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:08.46,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Tokugawa, don't let your father down !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.38,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:14.10,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Man, I was perfect in practice. \NWhat am I doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:28.36,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Is the ship alright ?\N It's so unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:31.84,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,Calm down, and take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:45.36,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,It's strange that two people who were enemies \Nonly a few years ago are now on the same ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:49.46,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,There're many issues of concern, but this peace....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.62,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,...mustn't be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:55.50,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Fly wheel activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:57.82,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Ten seconds to ignition\N of the wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:09:59.56,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.60,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.62,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...six...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:03.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...five...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:04.68,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...four...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:05.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.68,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.08,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:07.35,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,133)\3c&H0000FF&}Wave motion energy charge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:07.35,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0000FF&\frz8.826\pos(640,677)}Wave motion core pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.64,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Contact and ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.26,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamato, take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.44,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Domon ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.50,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.50,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Accelerate and take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.76,def2,{ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Yamato is not taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.52,def2,{ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, oh my gosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.44,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,What is she doing ? \NAt this rate, she'll run aground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:57.02,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.00,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.30,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.30,def2,{MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Look, Tsubasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:26.38,def2,{MAKOTO,0,0,0,,The Yamato...\NDad's ship is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:33.92,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Chikyuu wa itsushika tatakai wasure}Since Earth left fighting behind...\N{\i1}chikyū wa itsushika tatakai wasure\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:39.48,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Kagayaku midori ni tsutsumareta}...it's been covered with shining green\N{\i1}kagayaku midori ni tsutsu mare ta
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:45.24,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Osore mo nageki mo kokoro wo hanare}Fear and sorrow have left people's hearts\N{\i1}osore mo nageki mo kokoro o hanare
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:52.36,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Yasashii uta dake ga nagareteta}And all that's left is a gentle song\N{\i1}yasashī uta dake ga nagarete ta
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:58.10,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Jikan yo tomare, heiwa no mamade}Stop time, so that peace will remain\N{\i1}jikan yo tomare heiwa no mamade
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:03.68,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Ima kono yume no kono jidai}Now is the age of dreams\N{\i1}ima kono yume no kono jidai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:08.96,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}Remember Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:15.54,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}Remember Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:21.32,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Ginga ni akai hoshi ga sugite}When the red star passes over the galaxy\N{\i1}ginga ni akai hoshi ga sugete
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:26.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Futatabi kageri ga sashita toki}When the darkness falls once again\N{\i1}futatabi kageri ga sashita toki
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:32.48,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H67E268&}{Arata na kao to arata na ketsui}New faces, new determinations and...\N{\i1}aratana kao to aratana ketsui
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:46.04,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,4000)}{\c&H67E268&}{Arata na Yamato ga tabi ni tatsu}...the new Yamato begins their journey\N{\i1}aratana Yamato ga tabi ni tatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.72,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.82,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,You let someone like him helm the Yamato ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.26,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:09.32,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Isn't it apparent that Domon \N illegally accessed personnel data ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.36,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Get rid of him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.38,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Why did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:17.30,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,You thought they wouldn't figure it out ?\NYou're such a moron, Domon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:19.68,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Doing this alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:26.74,def2,{SADO,0,0,0,,We didn't find any explosives \Nor abnormal objects in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.90,def2,{SADO,0,0,0,,You're healthy, just like any young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.32,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Domon Ryusuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.86,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I admit to falsifying my background\N and personal information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:38.80,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Your military status will be revoked. \NUnderstood ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.46,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Domon deserves to be a Yamato crewman because of his achievements and talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:51.30,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,As captain, I made that judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:56.34,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose a talented individual by raising unwarranted suspicion because of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:58.96,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Captain Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.98,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,{It appears to me that your bad \Nhabit has surfaced once again.}It appears to me that your \Nnasty habit has surfaced once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:06.84,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{Your bad habit of taking \Neverything on yourself.}Shouldering responsibility all on your own…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.14,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,…a nasty habit indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:14.70,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Pardon my intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:21.08,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Would you like another cup ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:31.16,def2,{MIKAGE,0,0,0,,A shuttle has left the Ginga, \Nheading for the Yamato as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:34.00,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,Engineering officer Yabu{Yarb} and Domon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.00,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,We're exchanging a \Nmutineer for a hacker, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.36,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.36,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.50,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Discharged, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.50,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:51.98,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,He's looked tormented ever since his father died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:58.34,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,He stopped smiling like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:04.20,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,What was he trying to do on the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:08.60,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it could be just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:12.84,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,“Don't let your father down.”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:20.40,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,It can't be the same. \NThat idiot embarrassed the 38th's students.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:25.30,Karaoke Translation op,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,{\frz352.5\c&H000008&\3c&HB7B7B7&\move(1820,398,1520,400,13,2766)}Fireboat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:34.86,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Domon !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:41.64,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,I'm Hirata, the resource department chief.\N Have you cooked rice before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.22,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.22,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Okay. \NHow about rice balls ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.04,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.24,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Then you're qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:54.10,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,As of now, you're assigned to the \Nresource department as a quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:55.78,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:16:02.10,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,We have some brass on board for this trip, \Nand we have to cook all of their meals by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:05.06,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Our situation's so dire that \Nwe could use help from cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.04,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,I have the Captain's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:08.72,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Well then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.22,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.94,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Cooking supports everyone,\Nand it's a tough battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:18.84,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.64,def2,{HIRATA,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:26.44,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.18,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,I have no pleasantries to\N exchange with an outsider.{nothing to share with an outsider.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.44,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yabu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:38.70,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Ms. Niimi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:45.18,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,Please understand that the current\N atmosphere is not exactly welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:50.74,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,I'll take the GeshVar-related material \Nto the technical analysis room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.06,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:07.44,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,I heard the troublemaker has\N been made into a rice cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.72,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,He's not the only problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:13.82,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Lack of human resources and fast-paced training...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:17.22,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Newbies all tend to get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:22.16,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,This Yamato fleet is like a newborn baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:26.80,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,...who needs to stand on its own two \Nfeet before reaching outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:30.26,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,It's not going to be easy, Captain Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:37.50,def2,{TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\a5\pos(765,770)}Training Day 1:\N Air Wing Mock Combat Training
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:37.10,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Yankee leader to all units. We'll begin mock combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.42,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,The new models are tough. \NStay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:44.32,def2,{SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,A training session before even \Nmeeting up with the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:47.12,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,I'll use this chance to kick their butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.30,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Don't get cocky, Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.30,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.18,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Hotel leader to all units, \Nlet's give them a warm welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:06.74,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,There they are !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:16.30,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.86,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Yankee 3, Sakamoto ! \NDon't push too hard !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.66,def2,{YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}If you crash into a asteroid, you're dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:32.34,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,That's why it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.04,def2,{ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Shot down three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.46,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:38.64,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Sakamoto Shigeru, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.74,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,A type of guy who rushes to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.66,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\i1}Target is Titan, a moon of the old Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.80,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\a5\pos(808,749)}Training Day 7:\NSpace Cavalry Descent Training
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.22,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coordinate with the Yamato air unit to descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:54.12,def2,{NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Raiden, if you cut corners just because \Nthis is a drill, I'll kick your ass !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:55.42,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Thanks for your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.22,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Caroline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.56,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're well escorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:08.92,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Whatever. \NLet's touch down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:09.96,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.58,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,That's Saturn...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:20.96,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{Ginga's restoration plan is \Nscheduled, but it will take time.}It's on Ginga's restoration plan \Nschedule, but it's a long ways off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:27.04,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I wish Iscandar would lend\N us another Cosmo Reverse...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:31.02,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,Please don't upset Starsha \Nwith such careless comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.50,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Alright !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:40.85,def2,{TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\a5\pos(1016,746)}Training Day 14:\NAnti-ship Combat Training
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:40.20,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare for anti-ship battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.18,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Right after a warp ? Is he a demon ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:46.60,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&\pos(930,1005)}All stations, prepare for anti-ship battle exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:48.60,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}All stations, prepare for anti-ship battle exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:52.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Aerial defense unit, move to the\N operation zone as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.86,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Hotel leader, clear for take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.76,def2,{ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Okay, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:15.94,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,Missiles hit to aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:17.98,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Massive shock to the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.62,def2,{MIKI,0,0,0,,Asuka's in firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.44,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:33.36,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,{Damn, Asuka used a defense shield again !}Dammit !\N Asuka used its defensive shield again !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:36.96,def2,{{{NISHINA,0,0,0,,Combat Tactical Chief Kitano,\N the timing was slow !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:37.86,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.40,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Combat rations !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:42.88,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I'm leaving it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.00,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,978)}Hurry, get going !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:44.00,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Combat rations !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.70,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Combat rations !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.98,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I brought your combat rations !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:50.76,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:21:00.52,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Did you figure out what\N it was just by looking at it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.84,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:13.06,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{So nice to be young. I can't fall behind.}Youth is quite something.\N Daddy can’t afford to fall behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.76,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,When can we leave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:22.56,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,Our escort hasn't arrived yet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.88,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,Leeza, why did you bring that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.68,def2,{LEZA,0,0,0,,I can't just leave them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:30.24,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,Flowers aren't edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:31.30,def2,{LIZA,0,0,0,,You can't eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:32.62,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.38,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,Listen, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:37.12,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,But you eat anything, even insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:38.60,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,How could you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:41.16,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,I have a baby inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.66,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,A baby ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:51.70,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,You'll be half-related because your \Nfather, Yabu, is not from Zaltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.12,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.92,def2,{LIZA,0,0,0,,A new sibling ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:01.24,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.54,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:06.08,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,When we get to Planet Galman...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:13.66,def2,{LIZA,0,0,0,,What was that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:45.20,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000008&\pos(386,1050)}Yamato, a New Departure!!
